00:58:18,000 --> 00:58:24,000
After is a 2019 American romantic drama film directed by Jenny Gage, who co-wrote the screenplay with Susan
McMartin, Tamara Chestna, and Tom Betterton, based on the 2014 novel of the same name by Anna Todd.

12
01:03:36,000 --> 01:03:42,000
It is the first installment in the After film series.

13
01:08:54,000 --> 01:09:00,000
The film stars Hero Fiennes Tiffin and Josephine Langford and follows a young woman who
begins to romance a mysterious student during her first months of college.

14
01:14:12,000 --> 01:14:18,000
The cast includes Selma Blair, Inanna Sarkis, Shane Paul McGhie, Pia Mia, Khadijha Red Thunder,
Dylan Arnold, Samuel Larsen, Jennifer Beals and Peter Gallagher in supporting roles.

15
01:19:30,000 --> 01:19:36,000
After premiered at The Grove in Los Angeles on April 8, 2019, and was
released in the United States on April 12, by Aviron Pictures.

16
01:24:48,000 --> 01:24:54,000
Despite negative reviews from critics, who criticized its screenplay and narrative glamorizing abusive
relationships, it was a commercial success, grossing over $69 million worldwide against its $14 million budget.

17
01:30:06,000 --> 01:30:12,000
A sequel, After We Collided, was released in 2020.

